ly those with dysphagia. These straws can facilitate aspiration during drinking, making them unsuitable for patients who may struggle with safe swallowing.", "VASOS DE BOCA ANCHA:Wide-mouth cups are recommended for patients with dysphagia to aid in safe drinking practices.", "ALIANZA MÁS NUTRIDOS:Alianza más nutridos is an organization focused on nutritional efficacy and combating malnutrition in various settings, including hospitals and communities.", "SOCIETY ESPAÑOLA DE NUTRICIÓN PARENTERAL Y ENTERAL:The Sociedad Española de Nutrición Parenteral y Enteral (SENPE) promotes multidisciplinary consensus on the approach to hospital malnutrition in Spain.", "JENSEN GL:Jensen GL is a prominent researcher and author in the field of nutritional assessment and malnutrition. He has made significant contributions to the understanding of malnutrition syndromes and their implications in clinical practice. Additionally, Jensen GL has been actively involved in the development of clinical practice guidelines for diagnosing malnutrition, further establishing his expertise and influence in this critical area of healthcare.", "MIRTALLO J:Mirtallo J is a contributor to the international consensus guidelines on malnutrition.", "COMPHER C:Compher C is a prominent figure in the field of clinical nutrition, recognized for their significant contributions to various guidelines and proposals aimed at improving patient care. They are a co-author of a proposal focused on etiology-based diagnosis in clinical practice concerning malnutrition, highlighting their commitment to addressing nutritional deficiencies in clinical settings. Additionally, Compher C has contributed to clinical guidelines for nutrition support specifically tailored for hyperglycemic patients, demonstrating their expertise in managing complex nutritional needs. They are also an author of clinical guidelines related to nutrition support in renal failure, further showcasing their involvement in critical areas of patient nutrition management. Furthermore, Compher C has played a key role in authoring the ASPEN clinical guidelines for nutrition screening, which are essential for identifying patients at risk of malnutrition. Lastly, they are one of the authors discussing treatment outcomes of early enteral versus early parenteral nutrition, contributing to the ongoing discourse on optimal nutritional strategies in clinical practice. Overall, Compher C's work reflects a deep commitment to enhancing nutritional support across various patient populations.", "DHALIWAL R:Dhaliwal R is an author who is actively engaged in the systematic review of nutrition support in acute pancreatitis. Additionally, Dhaliwal R contributes to the development of guidelines concerning the diagnosis of malnutrition. Through these efforts, Dhaliwal R plays a significant role in advancing knowledge and practices related to nutrition in clinical settings.", "FORBES A:Forbes A is a prominent author of the ESPEN guidelines on clinical nutrition in inflammatory bowel diseases. Additionally, Forbes A plays a significant role in the international consensus on the diagnosis of malnutrition, contributing to the advancement of nutritional standards and practices in clinical settings.", "FIGUEREDO GRIJALBA R:Figueredo Grijalba R is a contributor to the guidelines for diagnosing malnutrition in clinical settings.", "NUTRITIONAL RISK SCREENING (NRS2002):Nutritional Risk Screening (NRS2002) is a method developed for assessing nutritional risk based on clinical trials.", "TOULOUSE FRAILTY PLATFORM:The Toulouse Frailty Platform is a research initiative focused on frailty and nutritional assessment in elderly populations.", "GUÍA DE DIAGNÓSTICO Y TRATAMIENTO NUTRICIONAL Y REHABILITADOR DE LA DISFAGIA OROFARÍNGEA:A comprehensive guide focused on the diagnosis and nutritional treatment of oropharyngeal dysphagia, edited by Clavé Civit P and García Peris P."], "parameters": {"model": "text-embedding-3-small", "temperature": 0.0, "freque